<speak>Telephone appointments do remove that surrounding travel. We can also keep the conversation orderly without requiring you to sit in a meeting room. I will move to the next part now, and then leave space for you before we continue. Let me confirm your objective: you want to reduce your exposure to bond-market fluctuations and make part of your existing investments available for upcoming personal spending. There is no need to juggle the notebook and the telephone if you would rather put the notebook down for a moment. I am happy to wait while you get comfortable.</speak>